{"id":"29c276bf04747b93","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"Atomic Formula","display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["93-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","depends_on":["[[93-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span> is the fixed propositional-variable set of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtomicFormula}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtomicFormula}\\)</span> are the atomic-formula set and its membership predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{At}_{93}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{At}_{93}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{AtomicFormula}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{AtomicFormula}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The former one-place predicate depended on an unrecorded set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>. Book 93 fixes one variable set, so that hidden parameter is removed rather than silently captured.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$ is the fixed propositional-variable set of [[93-df-variable]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtomicFormula}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{At}_{93}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{AtomicFormula}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"exce